Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.84,Default,,0,0,900,,Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.84,0:00:13.54,Default,,0,0,900,,Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:19.24,Default,,0,0,900,,He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.64,Default,,0,0,900,,does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.24,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.54,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:33.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hello everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:35.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Welcome to the Laughing Man Room!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.34,0:01:40.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well well, to think he'd return after\Nsix years in hiding...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's pretty surprising, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.64,0:01:45.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I certainly was surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:47.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Though it might be inappropriate,\Nconsidering the circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.94,0:01:50.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,as the net master, Onba, I felt my blood stir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.24,0:01:53.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those here right now are\Ndiehard Laughing Man "freaks".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.04,0:01:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But they also have no intention\Nof entering the debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:02:01.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop talking like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.24,0:02:04.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You'll get... attacked... in the comments...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.33,0:02:20.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I heard that there'll be\Npeople here in this chatroom
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:23.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who'll be discussing interesting\Nthings about the Laughing Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.83,0:02:25.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who among you would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.53,0:02:28.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think all of us here would fit the description.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.73,0:02:31.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although there are those who\Ndon't quite meet the criteria.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.53,0:02:33.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:34.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:43.00,Default,,500,0,450,,The Man \N Who Lurks \N In The Net's \N Dark Depths
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.67,0:02:48.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, what's this about the Laughing\NMan dying right after he reappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:51.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was just starting to hope that I could\Nbecome one of the real-time freaks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you getting worked up about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:56.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one's complaining about\Nthings like that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.17,0:02:57.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How idiotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:03:01.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Speaking of "idiotic", I think that your\Nappearance qualifies in that category.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:05.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, hurry up and give us\Na topic worth discussing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.57,0:03:12.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right then, why don't we discuss why the Laughing Man\Nsuddenly reappeared and made an assassination threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.87,0:03:14.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Allow me, teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.27,0:03:18.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think it's because the world\Ncontinues to be boring and full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:19.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We know that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.07,0:03:22.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What I'm trying to get at is,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:26.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,could it be that this incident and the incident\Nsix years ago were perpetrated by different men?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:28.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Men"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:31.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You don't even know if the\NLaughing Man is actually male.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.47,0:03:32.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Laughing Man is a he.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:36.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,According to information from a particular\Nsource, he has to be a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:37.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Besides, if the person was female,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:39.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,would she call herself the "Laughing MAN"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.47,0:03:40.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.87,0:03:44.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think you'd realise this if you'd\Nlook closely at the available data.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:48.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The person has not referred to\Nhimself as the Laughing Man even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:50.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even so, he's a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:52.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Remember that broadcast when he\Nkidnapped the company's president?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.27,0:03:53.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He definitely looked like a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.87,0:03:56.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's easy to explain.\NHe could have been wearing a male cyborg body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.57,0:04:03.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait a second, you're going off topic here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.37,0:04:06.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,don't you have any thoughts on how this incident is too different\Nfrom his past "style", which was limited to corporate terrorism?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.67,0:04:11.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although this incident also started from\Nsuspicions over a micromachine company,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,don't you think that it was too crude of him to plunge\Nheadlong into an assassination attempt on the Commissioner?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:19.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, as the story goes,\Nit's true that he started off six years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:24.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,by hacking into the cyberbrains of the president's\Nsecretary and family members sending emails.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:28.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, are you saying that this recent\Nincident was perpetrated by a fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.37,0:04:30.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't that a strong possibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.17,0:04:32.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's been a full six years\Nsince he last disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:37.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't this incident just a farce that rode on the waves\Ngenerated by the Laughing Man's surging popularity on the net?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.77,0:04:44.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But what is the basis behind the belief that\Ncorporate terrorism IS the Laughing Man's style?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.37,0:04:48.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wasn't his first kidnapping also "crude"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:52.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, I don't think he did anything on\Nimpulse after kidnapping the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.97,0:04:54.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:57.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, it wasn't cool at all to\Nmanipulate someone else to assassinate others.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.77,0:05:01.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, the Laughing Man is\Nthought to be a Grade A+ hacker,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.27,0:05:03.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but he's never killed anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:07.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Heh, it was fun to see,\Nbut I guess it was all a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.37,0:05:08.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess it's better that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.87,0:05:12.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So much for being a real-time\NLaughing Man freak...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.57,0:05:13.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Poor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:19.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then... what are you reasons for\Nthinking that the Laughing Man is "cool"?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, of course he's cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:23.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How can you say that he isn't\Nafter all the things he's done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:26.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not saying that he's NOT cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:30.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If someone is "cool" for being a good hacker,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.67,0:05:35.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then it's true that the time-delayed virus\Nused in the incident was certainly a marvel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:38.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, it was made so well
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.47,0:05:41.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that not even the police could create a vaccine
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:45.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,until after it became active in\Nthe Security Police's cyberbrains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.37,0:05:46.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's true enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.87,0:05:51.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After all, it's even rumored that the police couldn't\Neven find a trace of the virus itself after the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:52.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.97,0:05:54.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, the perpetrator ended up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.87,0:05:56.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.17,0:05:59.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Since the guy that made the\Nvirus was killed by someone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:06:02.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it has to be that the guy was\Nfake and he ended up being killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.27,0:06:03.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By whom, and for what reasons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:04.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Allow me, teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:07.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was because of some\Nconspiracy by a secret society!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.67,0:06:07.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.37,0:06:12.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,according to information I got\Nfrom this particular source,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the victimized corporations had hired\Nassassins even before this incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:17.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Which "sauce" did you get it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.37,0:06:19.77,Comment,,0,900,900,,Note: He's making a pun out of "source" and "sauce" \N which have identical pronunciation in Japanese
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.67,0:06:19.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Pork cutlet? Oyster?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.47,0:06:22.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why would the corporations get rid of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.97,0:06:25.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, they've been waiting\Nfor a chance all this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.77,0:06:28.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They had cause to go after him after\Nall the threats and ransom demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.97,0:06:31.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They finally tracked him down when he made\Nthat assassination threat, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.97,0:06:34.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even so, what's the point in\Ngetting rid of an imposter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:36.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if he was the real thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:41.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,there's no way that they could've first found\Nsomeone that not even the police could identify.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.27,0:06:43.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Th-that's exactly what makes it out of character for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.27,0:06:47.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not very "cool" to be\Ntracked down so easily like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:50.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, how about this: he was\Nkilled by the real Laughing Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:52.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Of course that can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.47,0:06:53.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just as the police say,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.57,0:06:55.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the reasonable conclusion is that\Nthe Laughing Man was a complex entity
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that had some internal squabbling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:07:00.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, then can it be said that\Nwe're back to our first conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.67,0:07:04.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is, that the recent incident was\Ninstigated by a different "person".
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.97,0:07:06.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll ask this again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.67,0:07:10.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,what is the basis behind the belief that\Ncorporate terrorism is the Laughing Man's "style"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:11.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're to obsessed with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's because he wouldn't\Nbe "cool" otherwise, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:16.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But... please try to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.97,0:07:20.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Was the first incident all that "cool"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:32.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.00,0:07:36.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We have to go back to the beginning\Nif we are to properly discuss this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:40.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right then,\Nlet's look back on the Laughing Man Case
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.68,0:07:42.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,as a little break from the current debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.18,0:07:50.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is now 7:20 AM on February 3rd,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.96,0:07:52.18,Blue,,0,0,450,,Travellers Weather \N Forecast
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.18,0:07:52.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,time for the traveller's weather forecast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.68,0:07:55.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To all of you who're commuting to\Nwork this morning, my best wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.21,0:08:54.21,Comment,,1400,0,950,,Today's Weather
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:08:02.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Today, February 3rd, is just 100 days from\Nthe opening of the International Exposition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.08,0:08:07.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, for today’s poll,\Nwe've thought of this question:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.24,BLACK,,0,300,550,,2024 International Expo Japan \N 100 days until opening of the Awaji Expo
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.08,0:08:09.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Expo...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:09.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:17.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If so, then please tell the\Ntruth in front of the camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Stop this. You can't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.25,0:08:22.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.37,0:08:25.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Watching this is probably a bit boring now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.67,0:08:28.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but we can't really help that,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:30.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,since this was the only time someone who\Nmight have been the man himself was seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:34.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}If that promise you made a while ago is\Ntrue, then right here and now...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:34.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Have you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:36.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}I can't do that right now.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:40.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The programme's logo was overwritten with his mark.\NIt's incredibly detailed work, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:38.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Why don't you tell them?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}That won't have any meaning!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:42.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, not to mention the regional\Nweather forecast symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:43.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}SERANO-San, unless you speak the truth yourself...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:47.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although, there are rumours that that stuff changed\Nonly after they started broadcasting replays.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:49.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Whatever the details were,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:53.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,this is the origin of the Laughing Man\NCase, that shook the nation six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:09:02.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But he's not cool at all in that footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.46,0:09:04.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,His hands were trembling when\Nhe was holding the gun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.86,0:09:05.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You simpleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's what's cool about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:12.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, if you compare this with the\Nsubsequent corporate terrorism incidents,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:14.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,his actions were really rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.36,0:09:15.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:18.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's because he put himself in\Nthe danger in the beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:23.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,even though he was a Grade A+ hacker,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:25.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that we felt sympathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:29.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We felt that he was trying to lay bare\Nthe falsity of scheming corporations...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.86,0:09:30.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.26,0:09:32.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nah, that's what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.86,0:09:35.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While seemingly instigating\Nan overly-simple crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:38.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the cunning indicated by\Nhacking all the media sources...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.56,0:09:40.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's where his charisma lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.46,0:09:42.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You guys are so passionate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:44.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's like, "I love the Laughing Man", you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.76,0:09:47.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not like he actually sent out\Nthat message himself, even once.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:53.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In addition to SERANO Corporation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:57.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,it now seems that Japan Micromachine\NCorporation has been threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is most alarming news!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.30,0:10:12.80,Comment,,1200,0,350,,Special Emergency Report \N The Laughing Man Strikes Again!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.31,0:10:15.31,RED,,0,1200,880,,The Cybernetic Man: Part II
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Could those be an unknown number of office desks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:04.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This time, it is a threat made against Sagawa\NCybernetics Corporation's main division!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.85,0:10:09.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How in the world did he manage to move\Nall those desks in a single night?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.45,0:10:13.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It can surely be said that this is an\Nunprecedented case of corporate terrorism!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:14.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is he real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.25,0:10:15.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He has to be real, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.05,0:10:18.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please call the Nanoplant Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.05,0:10:24.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I mean, Satsuma Meditech is the largest\Ncorporation of its kind in Kyuushuu, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:27.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why would you send a killer\Nvirus into a place like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:28.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I have no idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.55,0:10:32.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He probably hacked into the\Ngardener bot last night and did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:33.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take the helicopter out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.77,0:10:37.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:42.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, I have a t-shirt with Mytel\NCorporation's mystery circle printed on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:47.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,After this, when it was\Ndecided to invest public funds
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.07,0:10:50.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,in order to offset public fear over the devaluation\Nof the victimized corporation's stocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.87,0:10:53.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the Laughing Man announced\Nthat he would cease his attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.27,0:10:54.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and disappeared into the dark depths of the net.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:59.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I remember that Kadoya once\Ntemporarily raised its stock price
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.77,0:11:02.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,by saying that there was a Laughing\NMan symbol in its snack products.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.67,0:11:04.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What do you think about the rumours
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:08.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that certain individuals made huge profits\Nusing the stocks of all those corporations?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:09.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If we were to base our judgement solely on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.07,0:11:12.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,then it's quite possible that the\NSatsuma Meditech case was a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:15.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is that a cute girl's intuition?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:18.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, why don't you try comparing the shift\Nin stock values for other victimized companies
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:20.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,with that of Satsuma's?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.97,0:11:22.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:25.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Satsuma was the only one that didn't\Nreceive government assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.77,0:11:27.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.77,0:11:32.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No one noticed, because all six corporations\Nprofited by about the same amount,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:33.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,after the ceasefire was announced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.07,0:11:38.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it's true that even the talk show where\Nthe threat was made felt pretty lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.47,0:11:41.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well then, it's decided.\NIt was all staged by the media.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.67,0:11:45.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now that we're reflecting on this anew,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:48.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the incident of six years ago seems to\Nhave a lot of inconsistencies as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:51.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess it would be a little too forced
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.37,0:11:52.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,to think that these attacks\Nwere all by a single person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.97,0:11:55.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, in the end, it means that it\Nwas carried out by a group, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.67,0:11:56.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There are quite a few critics out there
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.97,0:12:01.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who think that the mindset behind the\Nfirst and second bout of incidents differs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.27,0:12:04.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I want to push for a "single perpetrator" theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's a bit difficult to\Nstomach, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.27,0:12:12.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's no point in trying to figure out whether the\Ntwo incidents were perpetrated by the same person.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.67,0:12:14.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I feel that the key to unlocking this case
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.67,0:12:19.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,actually lies in the factors\Nthat lead to a chain of events
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:23.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,after both the kidnapping six years ago,\Nand the recent assassination threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.87,0:12:26.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, that's pretty sharp, lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.67,0:12:28.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think so, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:32.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All right then, let's think it over,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:35.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,while looking over the visual\Nfiles we have in stock here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.27,0:12:36.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, before we proceed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:40.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we'll delete the backup\Nfiles cached on the server,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:41.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so let's take a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.00,0:12:53.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, do you remember how
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.30,0:12:55.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the alleged designer of this mark, Paul,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:58.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,got taken in for questioning by the\Ntask force at the time of the attacks?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.40,0:13:00.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The one who kept saying that\Nhis design database got hacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:02.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and that the particular design was stolen?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.72,0:13:06.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, although it's true that he consequently\Nwas able to become a famous designer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.42,0:13:07.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I respect his abilities as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:26.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what the reason was behind the\Nhuge popularity of this case at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.13,0:13:28.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The mystery that seemed easy\Nto understand, yet was not,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.53,0:13:31.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and sensational events kept\Nhappening, with excellent timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.63,0:13:33.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You do say intelligent things sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:38.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The fact that Serano's president wasn't exactly\Ncooperative also fell into that area, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.33,0:13:42.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's still suspected that he made\Na deal with the Laughing Man, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:45.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, what spoke to me the most
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.23,0:13:50.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,was the heroic mentality and solitary\Nimage presented in the first incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.03,0:13:52.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, for me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:57.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This recent incident started during the press\Nconference over the interceptor's illegal use,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.63,0:13:59.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but was that also an indication\Nof a "heroic mentality"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:04.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And, it was none other than Serano Genomics\Nitself that developed the interceptors in question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.33,0:14:06.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't you feel that there are some\Nconnections to those in power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:08.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just as I thought, this is very interesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.43,0:14:10.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How should I say it? A one-hundred-million-strong\Nnation of detectives?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.23,0:14:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Basically, it results in a mass parallelization of the spectators!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.93,0:14:16.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How about this: everything was self-scripted and\Nself-acted farce by the micromachine industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.13,0:14:21.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the Laughing Man was a "program" designed\Nto manipulate stock values from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.43,0:14:22.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's too boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.03,0:14:24.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The Laughing Man does exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:27.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Maybe you just want him to exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.53,0:14:30.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But according to information\NI obtained from my source...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:31.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,{\i1}Heh, "source" again.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.33,0:14:34.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This incident generated two hundred\Nbillion dollars in the economy overall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:37.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's a pretty good raison\Nd'etre, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:42.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Everyone, since you all don't seem to want\Nto join in on my discussion very much,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.62,0:14:46.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll now present a special tidbit of\Ninformation I got from my own "source".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.62,0:14:53.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The police's official report that the simultaneous\Nmultiple failed assassination attempts
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.62,0:14:56.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,were all due to the virus that\NNanao-A unleashed is a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:00.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,On what basis?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.01,0:15:03.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah, identify the source of that information!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.71,0:15:05.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,"Source" yet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:09.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,By the way, how many times\Nhas JD used the term "source"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:10.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,since he arrived in this chatroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:15.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm curious myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:16.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To tell you the truth...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.51,0:15:19.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,At the time, I'd hacked my way\Ninto the scene of the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:20.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.81,0:15:23.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, are you saying that you were also\Nthinking of attempting an assassination?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.51,0:15:25.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,N, no, that's not it. I was just peeking in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.81,0:15:29.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,because I wanted to know what would happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.31,0:15:32.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, I think that the other\N39 people who were caught
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:34.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,were not being manipulated by the virus
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:37.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and were just there of their own free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:40.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There were other hackers just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.91,0:15:45.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think that there may be those in the\Naudience who tried to crack in as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:49.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although... everyone else seemed to be\Nfailing in their attempts for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.41,0:15:51.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you... see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.04,0:15:57.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If that were true, it would be a huge scandal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.74,0:15:59.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We wouldn't be able to trust anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.84,0:16:00.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So that's it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:05.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'd also thought of going to\Nthe ceremony hall that day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.60,0:16:06.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:07.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.40,0:16:12.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, isn't it possible that the Laughing\NMan was among the 39 who were arrested?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.10,0:16:13.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.10,0:16:19.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Those who were caught were either\Npassionate fans like us or mimics.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:23.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, you're saying that those people went there\Nin response to Nanao-A's assassination threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.90,0:16:25.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's not exactly that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:28.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I actually have another piece\Nof special information...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.70,0:16:30.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was net-diving after the incident occurred
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.60,0:16:38.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and I found a server registered under Nanao's\Nname that had been overwritten by him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.51,0:16:44.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.51,0:16:46.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:48.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:51.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is guarded by firewalls\Nwith offensive capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.41,0:16:53.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you dive in there at Level Six,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.21,0:16:56.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you'll see that there are many\Nsimulations of plans left in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.71,0:16:59.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Renewed threats to micromachine heavyweights...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.01,0:17:03.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is also plan to target the\Ncyborg food industry, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:05.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,All programs have a common point:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:10.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,their success hinges on a\Ndelayed fragmented virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.91,0:17:15.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But after that, there was one question left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.71,0:17:17.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nanao's commissioner assassination plan
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:21.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,doesn't actually exist among the simulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:25.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While having so many meticulous plans on hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.37,0:17:30.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,why did he suddenly move to\Nassassinate the commissioner?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:32.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've done good research.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.77,0:17:35.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's all I do, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:37.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.57,0:17:40.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Are you trying to say that\NNanao-A was yet another mimic
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.47,0:17:42.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who was affected by the assassination threat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:44.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is no other way to explain
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.27,0:17:46.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,why he threw out the rest of\Nhis carefully constructed plans
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.07,0:17:51.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and used his ace-in-the-hole on\Na careless assassination plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.77,0:17:54.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who was the one who made the\Nassassination threat, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:56.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're trying to read too much into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.67,0:17:59.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's try to decipher something more substantive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.37,0:18:03.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, doesn't his story seem pretty plausible,\Nafter being shown something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.87,0:18:05.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, let maeask you this, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.77,0:18:09.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why was it that there were no other\Ncybernetic attacks aside from Nanao's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.27,0:18:12.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,despite the fact that many others were caught\Ntrying to assassinate the commissioner?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.57,0:18:16.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It could be that only Nanao was\Nsupposed to attack that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.97,0:18:20.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And, it was already predetermined\Nthat he would fail and be caught,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.97,0:18:26.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,thus also making him the perpetrator behind\Nthe Laughing Man Case, six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:30.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who would benefit by creating such a scenario?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.27,0:18:32.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That would be, of course, the pol...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.69,0:18:43.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,H, hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:48.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You've been creating some\Npretty roundabout explanations,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:51.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but you've got it figured out to a good degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.66,0:18:59.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Did you see my sacrificial firewall?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.98,0:19:02.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,W, were you by any chance that lady
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.38,0:19:06.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,who was pinning down the Security Police?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:07.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:09.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes, I was watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:12.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That firewall was quite dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:15.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you have a fragment of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.62,0:19:20.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yes... This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:22.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.55,0:19:26.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're welcome...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:28.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,May I ask you a question, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:32.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought at first that the\NPolice were behind it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.55,0:19:34.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But that offensive firewall was clearly\Ndifferent from the police's firewall
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.95,0:19:38.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that was set up throughout the ceremony hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:40.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I've never seen such a firewall...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:43.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then, it WAS the Laughing Man, after all...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.65,0:19:45.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As a sign of my thanks for giving\Nme that fragment, let me warn you:
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:50.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If you know too much,\Nyou'll end up getting wiped out in real life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:56.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, did you get disconnected or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.45,0:19:59.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.35,0:20:03.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry but I think I'll\Nexcuse myself for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.45,0:20:05.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you saying?\NYou haven't finished what you were saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.05,0:20:07.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm sorry about all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.67,0:20:13.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Geez, what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.87,0:20:15.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It all feels lame all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:18.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, not that getting worked\Nup in a place like this
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.97,0:20:21.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,would let us get any closer\Nto the heart of the matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.57,0:20:23.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.17,0:20:26.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The real Laughing Man could\Nbe watching us right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:29.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're already too far gone\Nif you're thinking that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.07,0:20:33.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nonetheless, this case is just all too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.47,0:20:34.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're all going to get tired of it eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.74,0:20:38.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I think that the Laughing Man is a\Nphenomenon that was created as some symbol
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:43.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,by something random that was given\Nbirth to by this corrupted world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.04,0:20:46.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even this group,\Nwhich is being lead around in circles,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:48.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,is already a mimic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:51.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Still, even if all of this was\Nnothing but a random phenomenon,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.14,0:20:56.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,just as that "Babe Ruth" guy said,\NI do feel that there are some commonalities
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:21:01.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,between the first kidnapping incident and\Nthe assassination threat six years later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.34,0:21:07.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I feel that only those two specific incidents were\Nexecuted by perpetrators possessing the same ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.74,0:21:10.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,With regards to the scope, goal, and mentality,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:15.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,the others were but copies\Ncreated in the hero's absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.04,0:21:22.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Although it is quite doubtful that the perpetrator\Nbehind the two incidents is the "original".
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.24,0:21:25.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Lady, you're a sharp one!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:32.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is this a forced transfer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.17,0:21:35.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.33,0:21:43.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.23,0:21:46.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We're at a good point right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:48.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can't we stay connected a bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You miser!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:08.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, yeah. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.18,0:22:11.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dammit... I couldn't trace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.58,0:22:14.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What, did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.38,0:22:18.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Were you actually net-diving all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.08,0:22:21.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,God, you're so dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:26.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Eh, I can drive in my sleep around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.18,0:22:27.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, what was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.18,0:22:29.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.48,0:22:30.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm not going to say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:36.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A phenomenon created by\Nmimics without the original...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.98,0:22:39.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Two pieces that don't fit into that picture...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:42.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.28,0:22:44.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:19.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:27.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:39.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.54,0:23:55.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.94,0:24:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.14,0:24:00.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.84,0:24:03.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:05.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
